# Tor settings for onionglass.
#
# This Tor is only a client. Its SOCKS port is reachable only from the gateway, because the
# compose file puts both on a private network.

ClientOnly 1

# Every visitor session presents its own SOCKS credentials, and Tor keeps connections with
# different credentials on different circuits. ExtendedErrors makes Tor say why an onion site
# could not be reached, which the gateway turns into a readable message. OnionTrafficOnly makes
# Tor refuse any request that is not for an onion address, so nothing that gets hold of this
# port can use it to leave through an exit relay.
SocksPort 0.0.0.0:9050 IsolateSOCKSAuth IsolateClientAddr ExtendedErrors OnionTrafficOnly
SocksPolicy accept *

DataDirectory /var/lib/tor
AvoidDiskWrites 1
Log notice stderr
